message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PSIQIT: Python Scientific Quantum Information Toolkit"
authors:
  - name: "PSIQIT Contributors"
version: 1.0.3
date-released: 2026-09-10
url: "https://github.com/psiqit/psiqit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/psiqit/psiqit"
abstract: >
  PSIQIT is a comprehensive Python library for quantum information processing,
  providing tools for quantum circuit simulation, variational algorithms,
  quantum error correction, and open quantum systems dynamics.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - quantum simulation
  - variational algorithms
  - VQE
  - QAOA
  - quantum error correction
  - Lindblad dynamics
license: MIT
